      "rationale": "'Sapos yu save' (KJV, quesion) o 'yu save tru' (YLT, tok bilip) — tupela i gat strongpela ausait long ol man i tanim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "mystery",
      "subject": "ol quesion long ves 4",
      "rationale": "Foa quesion 'husat' na 'wanem nem' — tok i tapim save; narapela man i no inap tokim."
    },
    {
